        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Copies of the Agreement will be printed and distributed by the Board to all presently employed and newly hired employees and MCCSSE will be allocated 200 copies. If additional copies are needed by MCCSSE, the Board of Education agrees to supply them if they are available.",
