        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Any written communication to be given by one party to the other under this Agreement will be given by telegram, registered mail, regular mail, or personally receipted mail. If given by the Board, said notice will be sent to the Montgomery County Council of Supporting Services Employees, 973A Russell Avenue, Gaithersburg, Maryland, 20879. Either party may, by written notice, change the address and notice of it shall be given.",
